    "risks": [
      "Unsigned or weakly bound envelope variants could blur who promises what payload at a failed hop.",
      "Treating transport authorization as an envelope problem may hide required local refusal/accounting artifacts.",
      "Parent-seed status may invite overreading as design evidence for transport behavior it does not specify."
